msgid ""
"Which period tabs the card shows: any of day, week, month, comma separated. "
"All three by default; periods=\"day\" gives a single card."
msgstr ""
"Tab periode yang ditampilkan kartu: mana saja dari day, week, month, "
"dipisahkan koma. Ketiganya secara bawaan; periods=\"day\" memberi satu "
"kartu."

