"switch=\"no\" pins the card to these attributes. By default the visitor can "
"pick another sign or step the date, which adds ?aw_sign= and ?aw_date= to "
"the page URL."
msgstr ""
"switch=\"no\" mengunci kartu pada atribut ini. Secara bawaan pengunjung bisa"
" memilih zodiak lain atau menggeser tanggal, yang menambahkan ?aw_sign= dan "
"?aw_date= ke alamat halaman."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:45
msgid "Weekly Horoscope"
msgstr "Horoskop Mingguan"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:46
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current week, anchored to Monday. Rendered into the page, "
"not an iframe."
msgstr ""
"Horoskop untuk minggu berjalan, berpatokan pada hari Senin. Dirender ke "
"halaman, bukan iframe."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:53
msgid "Any date inside the week you want. Defaults to today."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal berapa pun dalam minggu yang Anda inginkan. Defaultnya adalah hari "
"ini."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:58
msgid "Monthly Horoscope"
msgstr "Horoskop Bulanan"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:59
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current month, anchored to the 1st. Rendered into the "
"page, not an iframe."
msgstr ""
"Horoskop untuk bulan berjalan, berpatokan pada tanggal 1. Dirender ke "
"halaman, bukan iframe."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:66
#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:178
msgid "Any date inside the month you want. Defaults to today."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal berapa pun dalam bulan yang Anda inginkan. Defaultnya adalah hari "
"ini."

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:71
msgid "Planet of the Day"
msgstr "Planet Hari Ini"

#: includes/views/partials/shortcode-cards.php:72
msgid ""
"Traditional planetary ruler of the weekday, with its glyph and themes. "
"Rendered into the page, not an iframe."
msgstr ""
"Penguasa planet tradisional hari kerja, dengan glif dan temanya. Dirender ke"
" halaman, bukan iframe."

