msgid "nakshatra"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Daily Panchang (tithi, nakshatra, yoga, karana, vara, rahu-kaal) for a date "
"and location, served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Roda peta natal yang disajikan oleh api.astroway.info sebagai iframe "
"responsif."

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Planet of the Day (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Planet Hari Ini (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "planet"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Traditional planetary ruler of the weekday, with its glyph and themes, "
"rendered into the page."
msgstr ""
"Penguasa planet tradisional untuk hari dalam seminggu, beserta lambang dan "
"temanya, ditampilkan di halaman ini."

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Planetary Hours (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Jam Planet (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "planetary hours"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "hours"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The twenty-four planetary hours of a day at one place, with the current one "
"marked."
msgstr ""
"Dua puluh empat jam planet dalam sehari di satu tempat, dengan yang saat ini"
" ditandai."

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Retrograde Status (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Status Retrograde (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "retrograde"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "mercury"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Whether one planet is retrograde right now, and when that changes."
msgstr "Apakah satu planet sedang retrograde saat ini, dan kapan itu berubah."

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Retrograde Planets (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Planet Retrograde (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "planets"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "All eight planets that station, and what each is doing today."
msgstr ""
"Kedelapan planet yang stasioner, dan apa yang masing-masing lakukan hari "
"ini."

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Rising Sign (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Tanda Naik (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "rising"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "ascendant"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The rising sign with its chart ruler. Needs coordinates: the ascendant is "
"the horizon at a place."
msgstr ""
"Tanda naik dengan penguasa bagannya. Memerlukan koordinat: ascendant adalah "
"horizon di suatu tempat."

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Solar Return (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Solar Return (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "solar return"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "birthday"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "year ahead"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The chart of the moment the Sun returns to its birth position in a given "
"year, drawn into the page. Without a birth date it asks the visitor. Needs a"
" site key or an API key."
msgstr ""
"Bagan saat Matahari kembali ke posisi kelahirannya pada tahun tertentu, "
"digambar di halaman. Tanpa tanggal lahir, bagan ini menanyakannya kepada "
"pengunjung. Memerlukan kunci situs atau kunci API."

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Synastry Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Peta Natal (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "synastry"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/synastry/block.json blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "love"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Compatibility score and the cross-aspects behind it for two birth charts, "
"rendered into the page by api.astroway.info. No key needed."
msgstr ""
"Skor kesesuaian dan aspek silang di belakangnya untuk dua grafik kelahiran, "
"dibuat ke halaman oleh api.astroway.info. Tidak perlu kunci."

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tarot Spread of the Day (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Sebaran tarot hari ini (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "spread"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "celtic cross"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Three cards or the Celtic Cross, drawn once a day for this site, each card "
"read in its position. A visitor can draw again."
msgstr ""
"Tiga kartu atau Salib Keltik, ditarik sekali sehari untuk situs ini, setiap "
"kartu dibaca pada posisinya. Pengunjung bisa menarik lagi."

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Moon Transit Timeline (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Jadwal Lintasan Bulan (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "transit"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "week"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The next seven days of Moon ingresses, served by api.astroway.info as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Tujuh hari ke depan terkait pergerakan Bulan, disajikan oleh "
"api.astroway.info dalam bentuk iframe yang responsif."

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Transit Sky (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Peta Natal (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "sky"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the transiting planets' signs and degrees for a date, served by "
"api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Roda peta natal yang disajikan oleh api.astroway.info sebagai iframe "
"responsif."

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Week (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Horoskop minggu ini (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "weekly"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current week, anchored to Monday, rendered into the page "
"as text."
msgstr ""
"Ramalan bintang untuk minggu ini, yang dimulai pada hari Senin, ditampilkan "
"di halaman ini dalam bentuk teks."

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Year (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Ramalan zodiak untuk tahun ini (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "yearly"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "The year ahead for one zodiac sign."
msgstr "Tahun yang akan datang bagi satu zodiak."

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Zodiac Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Kecocokan Zodiak (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "How two zodiac signs read together."
msgstr "Bagaimana dua zodiak saling berpadu."

